@loomcli/core

This package includes material from uucode, from the Unicode Character
Database, and from Inquirer's figures. Its license field reads
"MIT AND Unicode-3.0": the Unicode tables named below stay under the Unicode
License v3, and every other file is under the MIT License in LICENSE or, for
the ported width iterator and the glyph catalog, in the licenses named below.
Neither license asks anything of an application that installs this package
beyond keeping these notices with the files they cover.

